{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01223",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 3.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.27,
      "end_seconds": 9.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.79,
      "end_seconds": 17.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got a stiff neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.09,
      "end_seconds": 20.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.89,
      "end_seconds": 24.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "It's been one week, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.42,
      "end_seconds": 28.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.27,
      "end_seconds": 31.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "I'd say mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.33,
      "end_seconds": 36.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.22,
      "end_seconds": 50.17,
      "duration_seconds": 11.95,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a rash that does not fade as well. I've also had hating the light, for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.74,
      "end_seconds": 54.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "I follow. I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.41,
      "end_seconds": 70.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Alright, that's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.83,
      "end_seconds": 86.47,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 108 beats a minute, pressure 120 over 74, saturation 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.31,
      "end_seconds": 91.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.72,
      "end_seconds": 95.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Alright, tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.32,
      "end_seconds": 110.15,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "Your neck is stiff, you are feverish, and there are purple spots that do not fade when pressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.02,
      "end_seconds": 118.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. So, did you get recent head injury or cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.6,
      "end_seconds": 123.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "No, no recent head injury or cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.17,
      "end_seconds": 129.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.23,
      "end_seconds": 132.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.36,
      "end_seconds": 136.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.97,
      "end_seconds": 139.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.61,
      "end_seconds": 142.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.0,
      "end_seconds": 146.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.92,
      "end_seconds": 149.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.94,
      "end_seconds": 157.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.0,
      "end_seconds": 161.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.87,
      "end_seconds": 166.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.27,
      "end_seconds": 172.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.35,
      "end_seconds": 175.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "I've got low haemoglobin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.07,
      "end_seconds": 184.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "Right, so low haemoglobin is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.96,
      "end_seconds": 204.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.15,
      "end_seconds": 210.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Actually, I'm on iron tablets, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.39,
      "end_seconds": 228.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.68,
      "end_seconds": 233.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "No, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.71,
      "end_seconds": 271.43,
      "duration_seconds": 25.72,
      "text": "I want blood cultures done, that's for possible meningitis. I'm going to order a lumbar puncture, for possible meningitis. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. For this, benzylpenicillin, 1.2 grams, once now, single dose. That should help with possible meningitis. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.68,
      "end_seconds": 274.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "That's simple enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.46,
      "end_seconds": 293.27,
      "duration_seconds": 12.81,
      "text": "Call an ambulance now, this is an emergency. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.57,
      "end_seconds": 300.66,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Ah. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.96,
      "end_seconds": 309.33,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "So, I take the benzylpenicillin, 1.2 grams, once now. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.05,
      "end_seconds": 316.43,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "Alright, yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.21,
      "end_seconds": 321.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}